      "Rufflet doesn't seem to know what to do..." => "Geronimatz scheint nicht zu wissen, was es tun soll...",
    },
    345 => {
      "However, I do sense a mysterious energy near us." => "Allerdings spüre ich eine geheimnisvolle Energie in unserer Nähe.",
      "I am very surprised the impact location cannot be seen from afar." => "Ich bin überrascht, dass man die Einschlagstelle von Weitem nicht sehen kann.",
      "LUNA: Let us investigate." => "LUNA: Lass uns nachsehen.",
